# DENY BY DEFAULT.
#
# The root .gitignore already names `incoming/` and `pack/`, but this directory is
# where the corpus lands, and the corpus is real contact data for 15,274 real
# congregations in a PUBLIC repository. A deny-list only protects against the
# folder names someone thought of; this allow-list protects against the ones they
# did not. Anything dropped here is invisible to git unless it is listed below.
#
# Before adding a line here, be certain the file carries no church names, emails,
# phone numbers, addresses or org_ids.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!published.json
!index.schema.json
